{"content_hash": "604ea5d5a3eef35d", "version_id": 783, "article_id": 79, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Kane wins Ballon d'Or as Putellas takes third award", "title_zh": "凯恩首夺金球奖，普特利亚斯第三次捧杯", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/football/live/2026/oct/26/ballon-dor-2026-updates-from-70th-edition-in-london-live", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1711234186672-00cfb626ea33?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8YmFsbG9uJTIwaGFycnl8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MzA2MTcyMnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Rob Griffin on Unsplash", "author": "Rob Griffin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@rgartprjkt?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-person-holding-a-red-balloon-with-a-picture-on-it-gwdbwUC-mLU?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(214, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(252, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "131ee3a62343"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-27", "word_count": 185, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "Harry Kane has won the men's Ballon d'Or for the first time, and Alexia Putellas won the women's award for the third time. The ceremony took place in London on Monday.", "lead_zh": "哈里·凯恩首次获得男子金球奖，阿莱克西娅·普特利亚斯则第三次拿下女子金球奖。颁奖典礼于周一在伦敦举行。", "preview": "Kane plays for Bayern Munich and England, and he is the first Englishman to win the award in 25 years. Last season he scored 77 goals in 68 ", "preview_zh": "凯恩效力于拜仁慕尼黑和英格兰队，他是25年来首位获此奖项的英格兰球员。上赛季他在68场比赛中打进77球，不过很多人没想到他这一年能这么强。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 766, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 62.275, "size_bytes": 374544, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 205, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 63.35, "size_bytes": 381024, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 205, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 67.6, "size_bytes": 406512, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 205, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 58.675, "size_bytes": 352944, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 205, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/79/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 63.95, "size_bytes": 384624, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 205, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/79/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@db7bbb0/content/data/versions/783.json", "paragraphs": ["Kane plays for Bayern Munich and England, and he is the first Englishman to win the award in 25 years. Last season he scored 77 goals in 68 games, although many people did not expect such a strong year from him.", "In his speech, Kane thanked his wife Kate and his children because they support him every day. He also thanked his parents and his brother Charlie, who has worked as his agent for many years.", "Putellas plays for Barcelona and Spain, and she has now won the women's prize three times. Barcelona also won women's club of the year for the third time in four years, while Paris Saint-Germain took the men's club award.", "Other winners included Lamine Yamal and Vicky Lopez, who both won young talent awards again, and Bukayo Saka, who received the Socrates award for his charity work. Luis de la Fuente was named men's coach of the year.", "Kane told young people that hard work matters even when nobody is watching. He said his journey was not easy, and he hoped his story could inspire others to believe in themselves."], "paragraphs_zh": ["凯恩效力于拜仁慕尼黑和英格兰队，他是25年来首位获此奖项的英格兰球员。上赛季他在68场比赛中打进77球，不过很多人没想到他这一年能这么强。", "在获奖感言中，凯恩感谢了妻子凯特和孩子们，因为他们每天都支持着他。他还感谢了父母和哥哥查理，查理多年来一直担任他的经纪人。", "普特利亚斯效力于巴塞罗那和西班牙队，如今已三次获得女子金球奖。巴塞罗那还四年内第三次当选年度最佳女足俱乐部，巴黎圣日耳曼则拿下最佳男足俱乐部奖。", "其他奖项方面，亚马尔和洛佩斯再次获得最佳年轻球员奖，萨卡则因慈善工作获得苏格拉底奖。德拉富恩特当选年度最佳男足教练。", "凯恩告诉年轻人，即使没人看着，努力也很重要。他说自己的路并不容易，希望自己的故事能鼓励别人相信自己。"], "body": "Kane plays for Bayern Munich and England, and he is the first Englishman to win the award in 25 years. Last season he scored 77 goals in 68 games, although many people did not expect such a strong year from him.\n\nIn his speech, Kane thanked his wife Kate and his children because they support him every day. He also thanked his parents and his brother Charlie, who has worked as his agent for many years.\n\nPutellas plays for Barcelona and Spain, and she has now won the women's prize three times. Barcelona also won women's club of the year for the third time in four years, while Paris Saint-Germain took the men's club award.\n\nOther winners included Lamine Yamal and Vicky Lopez, who both won young talent awards again, and Bukayo Saka, who received the Socrates award for his charity work. Luis de la Fuente was named men's coach of the year.\n\nKane told young people that hard work matters even when nobody is watching. He said his journey was not easy, and he hoped his story could inspire others to believe in themselves.", "body_zh": "凯恩效力于拜仁慕尼黑和英格兰队，他是25年来首位获此奖项的英格兰球员。上赛季他在68场比赛中打进77球，不过很多人没想到他这一年能这么强。\n\n在获奖感言中，凯恩感谢了妻子凯特和孩子们，因为他们每天都支持着他。他还感谢了父母和哥哥查理，查理多年来一直担任他的经纪人。\n\n普特利亚斯效力于巴塞罗那和西班牙队，如今已三次获得女子金球奖。巴塞罗那还四年内第三次当选年度最佳女足俱乐部，巴黎圣日耳曼则拿下最佳男足俱乐部奖。\n\n其他奖项方面，亚马尔和洛佩斯再次获得最佳年轻球员奖，萨卡则因慈善工作获得苏格拉底奖。德拉富恩特当选年度最佳男足教练。\n\n凯恩告诉年轻人，即使没人看着，努力也很重要。他说自己的路并不容易，希望自己的故事能鼓励别人相信自己。", "text": "Kane plays for Bayern Munich and England, and he is the first Englishman to win the award in 25 years. Last season he scored 77 goals in 68 games, although many people did not expect such a strong year from him. In his speech, Kane thanked his wife Kate and his children because they support him every day. He also thanked his parents and his brother Charlie, who has worked as his agent for many years. Putellas plays for Barcelona and Spain, and she has now won the women's prize three times. Barcelona also won women's club of the year for the third time in four years, while Paris Saint-Germain took the men's club award. Other winners included Lamine Yamal and Vicky Lopez, who both won young talent awards again, and Bukayo Saka, who received the Socrates award for his charity work. Luis de la Fuente was named men's coach of the year. Kane told young people that hard work matters even when nobody is watching. He said his journey was not easy, and he hoped his story could inspire others to believe in themselves.", "vocab": [{"word": "ceremony", "pos": "noun", "zh": "典礼，仪式", "note": "常与 hold / attend 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "award", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖项", "note": "win an award 获奖", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "although", "pos": "conj", "zh": "虽然，尽管", "note": "引导让步从句，后面接完整句子", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "score", "pos": "verb", "zh": "进球，得分", "note": "score a goal 进一球", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "speech", "pos": "noun", "zh": "演讲，致辞", "note": "give a speech 发表讲话", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "agent", "pos": "noun", "zh": "经纪人", "note": "球员的经纪人常用这个词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "prize", "pos": "noun", "zh": "奖，奖品", "note": "与 award 意思接近", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "charity", "pos": "noun", "zh": "慈善，慈善机构", "note": "charity work 慈善工作", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "coach", "pos": "noun", "zh": "教练", "note": "head coach 主教练", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "inspire", "pos": "verb", "zh": "激励，鼓舞", "note": "inspire sb to do sth 激励某人做某事", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-27T00:42:00.481318", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Kane", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.55, "sm": 275, "em": 550, "cs": 0, "ce": 4, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "plays", "s": 0.55, "e": 0.875, "sm": 550, "em": 874, "cs": 5, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "for", "s": 0.875, "e": 1.0, "sm": 875, "em": 1000, "cs": 11, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "Bayern", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.4, "sm": 1000, "em": 1399, "cs": 15, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "Munich", "s": 1.4, "e": 1.775, "sm": 1400, "em": 1775, "cs": 22, "ce": 28, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "and", "s": 1.775, "e": 1.9, "sm": 1775, "em": 1900, "cs": 29, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "England", "s": 1.9, "e": 2.65, "sm": 1900, "em": 2650, "cs": 33, "ce": 40, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": ",", "s": 2.65, "e": 2.75, "sm": 2650, "em": 2750, "cs": 40, "ce": 41, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "and", "s": 2.75, "e": 2.862, "sm": 2750, "em": 2862, "cs": 42, "ce": 45, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "he", "s": 2.862, "e": 2.938, "sm": 2862, "em": 2937, "cs": 46, "ce": 48, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "is", "s": 2.938, "e": 3.062, "sm": 2937, "em": 3062, "cs": 49, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "the", "s": 3.062, "e": 3.163, "sm": 3062, "em": 3162, "cs": 52, "ce": 55, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "first", "s": 3.163, "e": 3.5, "sm": 3162, "em": 3499, "cs": 56, "ce": 61, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "Englishman", "s": 3.5, "e": 4.075, "sm": 3500, "em": 4075, "cs": 62, "ce": 72, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "to", "s": 4.075, "e": 4.2, "sm": 4075, "em": 4200, "cs": 73, "ce": 75, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": "win", "s": 4.2, "e": 4.362, "sm": 4200, "em": 4362, "cs": 76, "ce": 79, "si": 0}, {"i": 16, "w": "the", "s": 4.362, "e": 4.45, "sm": 4362, "em": 4450, "cs": 80, "ce": 83, "si": 0}, {"i":